@startuml
!include style.iuml
|Provider|
|Website|
|Server|
|Server|
start
:Survey PUBLISHED\n(UC-14);
repeat
  |Provider|
  :Press Pause, Resume\nor Close;
  |Server|
  if (Allowed in this\nstate?) then ([yes])
    :Change the state:\nPAUSED, PUBLISHED\nor CLOSED;
  else ([no])
    :Refuse with\nthe message;
  endif
  |Website|
  :Show the survey list\nwith the message;
  |Server|
repeat while (Closed?) is ([no]) not ([yes])
stop
floating note right
  The server also closes a survey:
  the response that reaches the
  limit (UC-04), or a closing date
  that has passed, on the next read.
  Paused: respondents are refused.
end note
@enduml
